---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Changelog: Fudge Launcher">
  <div class="page"><div class="wrap narrow">
    <h1>Changelog</h1>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li>
        <span class="tag">Unreleased</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:.2rem;font-size:1.4rem">0.1: pre-alpha, in development</h2>
        <p>Nothing is released yet. Work so far: the Cargo workspace and CI, the answers engine (math, units, currency, time, emoji, colours), the core, platform and provider crates, and the first GTK4 window. Follow along on GitHub.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div></div>
</Base>
